# Gleaming Splendor: "Whenever an opponent draws their second card each turn, you create a Treasure token." On turn 2 Bot2's
# draw step is its first card (no Treasure); then Bot1 activates "{2}{W}: Two target players each draw a card" (paid with a Black
# Lotus, exactly) for Bot1 and Bot2, so Bot2 draws its second card and Bot1 gets a Treasure while Bot1's own draw makes none
# (CR 120.3, 603.2). Both targets must be different players (CR 115.3).

